   "szLabel": "Name",
   "szText": "The Kin of Cain",
   "hLabel": 4062401
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Phase97Description",
   "szText": "The thief's body had a note near it referencing Lorath's home in Fractured Peaks. Maybe he left something there aside from empty bottles.",
   "hLabel": 41701509
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Callback106Header",
   "szText": "Find the relic in the Windswept Cabin",
   "hLabel": 1281528845
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Phase108Description",
   "szText": "I read a note that referenced another Horadric Relic stashed in Yshari Sanctum. I should search it thoroughly.",
   "hLabel": 952617550
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Callback110Header",
   "szText": "Find the relic within {WORLD:DGN_Kehj_YshariSanctum}",
   "hLabel": 1791425640
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Phase120Description",
   "szText": "Davish mentioned he'd received report of a Horadric Relic. He pointed me to an area near Gea Kul. I should search outside the city.",
   "hLabel": 1340797512
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Callback119Header",
   "szText": "Find the relic outside of Gea Kul",
   "hLabel": 529735473
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Phase140Description",
   "szText": "Perhaps Davish has a lead on another Horadric Relic. I should ask him and see.",
   "hLabel": 4004054346
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Callback146Header",
   "szText": "Speak with Davish",
   "hLabel": 4251576209
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Phase157Description",
   "szText": "The trail to find more relics has gone cold again. I should place these relics with the others in Cerrigar. ",
   "hLabel": 2494536818
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Callback174Header",
   "szText": "Place the relics: {DONE_OVER_NEEDED}",
   "hLabel": 674950322
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Phase160Description",
   "szText": "Davish mentioned he'd received report of a Horadric Relic. He pointed me to an area near Gea Kul. I should search for clues to more relics around the thief's body there.",
   "hLabel": 2372343884
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Callback163Header",
   "szText": "Inspect the scavenger's note",
   "hLabel": 4009679632
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Phase166Description",
   "szText": "I found a relic in Lorath's home in Fractured Peaks. Perhaps there are clues to more relics there.",
   "hLabel": 3004909714
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
